6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Performer&#39;s Talent </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility and arcane resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Merciless Melody </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases attack speed for the party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Alin&#39;s Keening Lamentation </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals Instant Mental damage to the encounter. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Walt&#39;s Singing Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A quick attack that deals power damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Singing Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Fires two shots at once and deals mental damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Songster&#39;s Luck </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases group members offensive and defensive chances in combat including melee, ranged and magical combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Walk Lightly </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Allows stealthed movement at an increased movement rate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Insatiable Ardor </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increase to parry skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reproaching Discante </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reduces strength and agility on the target and surrounding encounter members within the area of effect. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Bard</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Taffo&#39;s Brilliant Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A flanking attack that deals medium damage and increases attack speed on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Melancholy Melody </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Plays a mournful melody for the dirge&#39;s party. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Noxious Chorus </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases Noxious mitigation for all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lanet&#39;s Excruciating Scream Dirge </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Weakens the target on initial application then deals mental damage on the songs end. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Misfortune&#39;s Kiss </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that reduces enemy agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Dirge</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Crypt&#39;s Quiet </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Augmentation that has a cha